      "importance": 75,
      "importanceReasonZh": "微软作为全球科技巨头，其裁员决策影响广泛，涉及员工、投资者和行业趋势，具有较高新闻价值。",
      "importanceReasonEn": "Microsoft's layoff decision as a global tech giant has wide impact on employees, investors, and industry trends, making it highly newsworthy.",
      "scoringMode": "ai",
      "titleZh": "微软公司转型最新动态",
      "titleEn": "The latest in our company transformation",
      "summaryZh": "微软执行副总裁兼首席人力官Amy Coleman向员工传达了公司转型的最新消息：为聚焦人员、投资和战略重点，公司将裁减约4800个岗位，占全球员工总数的2.1%。此举旨在优化资源配置，推动公司未来发展。",
      "summaryEn": "Amy Coleman, EVP and Chief People Officer, communicated to employees that Microsoft will eliminate around 4,800 roles, about 2.1% of its global workforce, as part of its transformation to focus people, investments, and strategic priorities.",
      "keywords": [
